---
description: Repo map, truth-vs-belief rule, scope
alwaysApply: true
---
- Core simulation: `core/Runtime/` (engine-free, C# 9). Unity glue: `unity/LowObservable/Packages/com.brennandrake.lowobservable.unity/`.
- Escape campaign: the player sees truth and WARDEN's belief (`Stage.Tracker`). Units and dispatch act on the tracker only; sensors are the only path from truth to belief. Tools change sensor reports, never trackers or units.
- Drone prototype: truth (`Episode.TruePose`, `Seeker.Pose`, `TrueLandmarkId`) is for the simulation, reveal screen, debug overlay and tests only.
- Keep changes scoped to the task; no drive-by refactors.
